<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1.These Results have been recommended by Audit Committee &amp; approved by Board of Directors on 8/8/2019. 2. Limited Review of these UFR has been carried out by Statutory Auditors.3.Figures of quarter ended 31/03/019 is balancing figures between audited figures in respect of full FY ended 31/03/2019 &amp; published year to date figures upto Q3 of 31/12/2018.4. During previous FY, process of voluntary liquidation of GIPCL Projects &amp; Consultancy Company Limited (GIPCO), a wholly owned subsidiary, was initiated &amp; affairs of GIPCO were handed over to Liquidator. The winding up of GIPCO by the Liquidator wef 3/01/2019 &amp; was closed on 20/03/2019. GIPCL has received Rs.37.50 lakhs as liquidation distribution proceeds as against its investment of Rs.25.00 Lakhs and GIPCO has no assets or liability from previous year end. Given completion period of liquidation processed and reports submitted by Liquidator &amp; GIPCO having no assets, liabilities or outstanding members balance as at 30/06/2019, no consolidated Results are presented by Company.5.Effective 1/04/2019, company has adopted IndAS116�Leases�.The Standard primarily requires Company, as a lessee to recognize, at commencement of lease a right-of �use (ROU) asset and leasability representing present value of unpaid as e payments) Such ROU assets are subsequently depreciated and lease liability reduced when paid, with interest on lease liability recognized as finance costs. The Company has elected to use "Modified retrospective approach" i.e. where cumulative impact, if any, recognized on date of initial application (01/04/19). As a result of adoption of Indian Accounting Standard (Ind AS) 116�Leases,there is no impact on retained earnings as at 1st April, 2019 &amp; there is no material impact on financial results for Q1 6. Company has only one reportable business segment viz. "Power Generation". 7.Figures of previous period have been re-grouped /re-arranged wherever necessary.8.The Company has an exclusive e-mail ID viz. investors@g</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
